      "guidance": "Inspect the repository first (inspect_project.py): existing components, tokens, fonts, breakpoints, and conventions win. Reuse the existing component; if it lacks a variant, extend it through its API; if the composition is new, compose existing primitives; only create a new primitive when the gap is real, and put it where the others live.",
